<title>CANADA: Videotron year Aug 31 profit turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Videotron year Aug 31 profit turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr    Loss	     C$0.33   Profit	C$0.11</p>
<p> Net    Loss	     33,990   Profit	18,861</p>
<p> Revs		     846,930		  740,595</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Groupe Videotron Ltee. Excluding an extraordinary gain of C$64.5 million related to the dilution of Groupe Videotron's ownership interest in Videotron Holdings Plc after its initial public offering, and reductions in the value of certain assets of C$22.9 million, the net loss for 1995 would have been C$22,753,000, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Montreal bureau (514) 985-2434</p>
</text>
